  "回正指触地前至少一个 20 ms 采样点的倾角小于 10°、总角速度小于 0.5\nrad/s。平稳落地继续使用现有驾驶判定，要求轮胎稳定支撑一秒，且没有车身碰撞或超限冲击。回正不等于安全落地。": "Recovery requires a tilt below 10 degrees and total angular speed below 0.5 rad/s at one or more 20 ms samples before contact. Safe landing retains the existing criteria: one second of stable tire support, no body collision and no excessive impact. Recovery and safe landing are separate outcomes.",
  "这批样本覆盖均匀随机姿态、球面均匀旋转轴、2–12 rad/s 角速度、6–20 m\n重心高度、−4 至 +5 m/s 竖直速度和 5 m/s 水平速度。所有样本均从 400 kg\n满气、12\n个喷嘴正常的状态开始，位于远离障碍的地面上方。失败样本全部计入。这是压力测试分布，不是实测玩家事故分布，不能直接推断实际玩家成功率。": "Cases use uniform random orientations and rotation axes, angular speeds of 2–12 rad/s, CG heights of 6–20 m, vertical speeds of −4 to +5 m/s and horizontal speed of 5 m/s. Each starts above clear ground with 400 kg of gas and 12 working nozzles. All failures count. This stress-test distribution does not measure player incidents and cannot establish the player success rate.",
  "原始数据为": "Raw data: ",
  "，包含初态、逐例结果、参数及源代码哈希。前期用另一批\n100 个初态开发，没有将其混入上述独立验证。": ". Records include initial states, individual outcomes, parameters and source hashes. A separate set of 100 states was used during development and is excluded from this validation.",
  "原因与改动": "Cause and changes",
  "原控制器把横滚、俯仰、偏航合成一个力矩请求，再整体缩放。复合旋转样本": "The previous controller combined roll, pitch and yaw into one torque request, then scaled the whole request. In the compound-spin case ",
  "中，偏航请求约 82.1\nkN·m，但对应方向只能输出 10 kN·m，三个力矩一起缩到约\n12.2%。俯仰执行力矩只有约 12.5\nkN·m，升力分配为零。油罐仍有气，并不说明这些喷嘴已经把可用力矩分配给旋转制动。": ", requested yaw torque was about 82.1 kN·m against a 10 kN·m limit. All torques were reduced to about 12.2%, leaving about 12.5 kN·m of pitch torque and no lift allocation. Remaining gas alone does not mean available nozzle torque is being used to brake rotation.",
  "新增的": "The new ",
