  "每次控制更新都根据当前姿态重新规划回正，避免碰撞后继续追逐旧路径的姿态点。": "Replan from the current attitude at each control update, rather than following obsolete waypoints after a collision.",
  "横滚或俯仰转速过高时先制动，降速后再回正。制动阶段不加入可能占满喷嘴能力的陀螺补偿；测试检查执行力矩对旋转做负功。": "Brake excessive roll or pitch before recovery. During braking, omit gyroscopic compensation that could consume nozzle capacity. Tests check that executed torque removes rotational energy.",
  "分别分配横滚/俯仰、升力、偏航，避免一个偏航极限同时压低其他方向的制动。刹降优先于航向调整。": "Allocate roll/pitch, lift and yaw separately so yaw saturation cannot suppress other braking axes. Descent braking takes priority over heading alignment.",
