  "保留原有压力衰减、25 ms\n阀门滞后、总喷力限制、质量与惯量变化、碰撞、补气时序、辅助开关及落地判定。没有设置车身姿态或直接修改角速度。用户主动触发的一圈翻转继续使用冻结的\nv4 控制器，飞行实验与历史训练文件不变。": "Pressure decay, 25 ms valve lag, total thrust limits, variable mass and inertia, collisions, refill timing, assist settings and landing criteria are retained. The controller does not set body attitude or directly change angular velocity. User-triggered flips still use the frozen v4 controller; flight experiments and historical training files are unchanged.",
  "额外悬停等待偏航完成的开发方案增加了耗气并造成更多低压落地失败，最终代码没有采用它。": "A development approach that hovered to finish yaw alignment consumed more gas and increased low-pressure landing failures. It is excluded from the final controller.",
