  "99% 目标的剩余工作": "Remaining work toward 99%",
  "独立验证仍有 55/200\n个平稳落地失败，不能把它们全部认定为物理不可救。下一步需要区分剩余控制问题与高度、气压、喷嘴方向等限制，加入邻近坡面碰撞的预测，并在约定的玩家事故分布上重新验收。当前纵向预测仍针对水平地面，没有预测即将撞回坡侧的时间。": "Independent validation still has 55/200 failed safe landings. These cannot all be called physically unrecoverable. Further work must separate controller issues from height, pressure and nozzle-direction limits, predict nearby ramp collisions and validate against an agreed distribution of player incidents. Current vertical prediction assumes flat ground and does not predict time to ramp-side impact.",
  "没有降低落地标准、增加喷嘴推力、无限补气或自动摆正来提高成功率。浏览器交互检查与数值压力测试分别验收。尚未完成实体手机性能验证或实车标定。": "Landing criteria and nozzle thrust have not been relaxed; unlimited refills and automatic pose resets are not used to increase success. Browser interaction checks and numerical stress tests are separate. Physical phone performance and real-vehicle calibration remain unverified.",
