  "：消耗储气质量，受总冲量、最大推力与力矩约束。": ": They consume stored gas mass and are constrained by total impulse, maximum thrust and torque.",
  "理想开放桨盘有": "For an ideal open actuator disk,",
  "，真实涵道、车身和地效会改变工作点。该关系仅作功率量级约束，不能拿单体静推力代替整车下压力。": ", the actual duct, body and ground effects will change the operating point. This relationship only serves as a power magnitude constraint, and the static thrust of a single unit cannot be used to replace the downforce of the entire vehicle.",
