  "本轮结果": "Results of this round",
  "60 代、6,648 次训练与开发评估完成，保留第 40\n代。标准零水平初速与带初速度的一圈均从硬接触改善为通过，最大接触闭合速度分别从\n1.53、2.91 m/s 降到约 0.27、0.25 m/s。标准演示不能代替泛化评估。": "60 generations and 6,648 training and development evaluations were completed; generation 40 was retained. The standard full-turn cases with zero and nonzero initial horizontal velocity both improved from hard contact to a pass. Their maximum contact closing speeds fell from 1.53 and 2.91 m/s to about 0.27 and 0.25 m/s respectively. Standard demonstrations do not replace generalization evaluation.",
  "新留出初态，每种目标 20 例": "New held-out initial states, 20 cases per target",
  "训练前，2 ms": "Before training, 2 ms",
  "训练后，2 ms": "After training, 2 ms",
  "7–14 m，回正": "7–14 m, upright recovery",
