  "物理与证据": "Physics and Evidence",
  "贴坡靠压差，离地靠喷气，回正靠力矩。": "Sticking to the slope relies on pressure difference, lifting off the ground relies on air jets, and upright recovery relies on torque.",
  "Tesla官网已确认风机、底部密封和冷气推进，但没有公布完整质量、推力曲线或控制遥测。": "Tesla’s official website confirms fans, underbody sealing and cold-gas propulsion, but does not publish complete mass, thrust curves or control telemetry.",
