  "一维制动近似；喷口竖直力、接触点速度、悬架行程共同决定结果": "One-dimensional braking approximation; nozzle vertical force, contact point speed, and suspension travel jointly determine the result",
  "唯一保留的直觉算例：": "The only remaining intuitive calculation example:",
  "假设2吨、有效面积4\nm²，水平倒挂临界压差约4.9 kPa": "Assuming 2 tons and an effective area of ​​4 m², the critical pressure difference for horizontal inversion is about 4.9 kPa",
  "；μ=1、135°斜面则约6.94\nkPa。两者均不是Tesla实测。": "; μ=1, 135° slope is about 6.94 kPa. Both are not actual measurements by Tesla.",
  "风扇的压差吸附与排气反作用共享能量，不能各算一份完整功率。": "The pressure difference suction of the fan and the exhaust reaction share energy, and each cannot be counted as a complete power.",
  "风扇模型与专利": "Fan models and patents",
  "任意姿态都能回正，需要足够时间、空间、控制力矩和剩余气量。": "Recovery from any attitude requires sufficient time, space, control torque and remaining gas.",
