  "。训练页面展示有限样本与失败案例。静止起转并刹停的理想下界为": ". The training page shows limited samples and failure cases. The ideal lower bound for starting and stopping from a standstill is",
  "；向下速度v还需至少": "; downward speed v also requires at least",
  "的制动余量。这些是必要约束，不是充分保证。": "braking margin. These are necessary constraints, not sufficient guarantees.",
