  "尾翼": "Rear wing",
  "整宽翼板由左右细支座抬起，尾灯在其下；收纳和展开分开处理": "The entire width of the wing is lifted up by thin supports on the left and right, with the taillights underneath; storage and deployment are handled separately.",
  "官网形态高": "High for the official-site shape",
  "尾部": "Rear",
  "上排四小喷口、下排四大风扇舱，另有左右朝下喷口；不能画成一排排气管": "There are four small nozzles in the upper row, four large fan compartments in the lower row, and nozzles facing downwards on the left and right sides; it cannot be drawn as a row of exhaust pipes.",
