  "底盘": "Chassis",
  "原型下沿较厚，周边喷流硬件外露；完整密封裙和管路不可见": "The lower edge of the prototype is thicker, and the peripheral jet hardware is exposed; the complete sealing skirt and pipeline are not visible",
  "中": "Medium",
  "悬架": "Suspension",
  "新图可见横置弹簧减震器、摇臂与连杆，不足以恢复运动学": "The new picture shows the horizontal spring shock absorber, rocker arm and connecting rod, which is not enough to restore kinematics",
  "图中形态高；原型对应低": "High for the pictured form; low for correspondence to the prototype",
  "尾部细节用": "For tail details",
  "展开组合图": "Exploded composite view",
  "正后特写，3456×2800": "Frontal close-up, 3456×2800",
  "Tesla X\n尾部图": "Tesla X rear view",
  "新增悬架图": "Added suspension diagram",
  "适合局部机械细节。": "Suitable for local mechanical details.",
  "近侧视的手工图像比例约为轴距/车长 0.62–0.67、车顶高度/车长\n0.24–0.29、轮径/车长\n0.145–0.175。这是透视图中的美术检查范围，不是真实尺寸。原型09帧复核为\nH/L .27–.30，旧180 px高度含错误底点。统一模型采用4.1×1.72×1.20\nm作为明确假设，H/L≈.293；不称官方或标定尺寸。读点和局限见": "The hand-made image ratios for the near side view are approximately wheelbase/vehicle length 0.62–0.67, roof height/vehicle length 0.24–0.29, wheel diameter/vehicle length 0.145–0.175. This is an artist's inspection range in perspective, not true size. Prototype 09 frame review is H/L .27–.30, the old 180 px height contains the wrong bottom point. The unified model uses 4.1×1.72×1.20 m as an explicit assumption, H/L≈.293; it is not called official or calibrated size. See reading points and limitations.",
  "共新增 5 张官网原图，均保留原 URL\n与尺寸。未把太空合成图当作原型证据。图片版权归\nTesla，未确认开放复用授权。完整部件记录与 15 项来源见": "A total of 5 new official website original images have been added, all of which retain the original URL and size. Composite images of space were not considered prototype evidence. Image copyright Tesla, no open reuse license confirmed. Full parts record with 15 sources see",
  "结构化清单": "structured list",
  "本轮车模路线": "Modeling routes in this round",
  "Kimi k3 以 max 思考读取四张官网实图，独立生成车壳。Codex\n派生版修正插值波纹、玻璃与车漆交叠、轮圈比例和风挡前缘，原件保留供比较。两份\nGLB 都可下载；前脸、后肩和窗框仍近似，不能视为精确 CAD。": "Kimi k3 uses max thinking to read four official official website real pictures and independently generate the car shell. The Codex derivative corrects interpolated waviness, glass and paint overlap, rim proportions and windshield leading edge, the original is retained for comparison. Both GLBs are available for download; the front fascia, rear shoulders and window frames are still approximate and cannot be considered exact CADs.",
  "Meshy\n登录成功，但创建被免费套餐限制拒绝；用户选择暂不升级，未生成。第三方检索排除了名称含“2026”但实际发布于\n2023 年的旧车型，本轮未找到已验证可用的新车体下载。": "Meshy logged in successfully, but the creation was rejected by the free plan limit; the user chose not to upgrade yet and it was not generated. The third-party search excluded old models with \"2026\" in their names but actually released in 2023. No verified and available new body downloads were found in this round.",
  "用户提供的 Meshy 模型": "User-contributed Meshy models",
  "用户另行手动生成并提供\nGLB。已按完全独立的连通组件删除外围四墙，汽车40,564面原样保留。它适合作为外形与中远景运动底稿；车侧、轮圈和封闭底部仍简化，文件没有UV、贴图或材质。网页新增“Meshy\n去墙白模”供比较，未替换物理碰撞模型。": "The user independently generated and supplied a GLB. Four surrounding walls were deleted as wholly separate connected components, preserving all 40,564 body faces. It suits shape prototyping and medium-to-long shots; body sides, rims and the closed underbody remain simplified, and the file has no UVs, textures or materials. The website adds the “Meshy body with walls removed” for comparison; the physics collision model is unchanged.",
  "十个高清选帧": "Ten HD frame selections",
  "均为1920×1080。X版与YouTube代理相差一帧，下面是X文件内时间；不是实际滞空时间。": "Both are 1920×1080. There is one frame difference between the X version and the YouTube proxy. The following is the time in the X file; it is not the actual time in the air.",
  "镜头": "Shot",
