  "当前入口是": "The current entrance is",
  "。回正和完整\nkickflip\n使用同一个反馈器与同一组训练参数。页面可以比较训练前后、选择各代检查点，并改变初态重新做物理试验。": ". Upright recovery and full kickflip use the same feedback controller and the same set of training parameters. The page can compare before and after training, select checkpoints of each generation, and change the initial state to re-do physical experiments.",
