  "本轮每代 18 个候选各测 6 个初态，使用 CEM 搜索一组共享参数。第 1\n代放入一个明确标注的人工参考候选。最终参数按固定开发集选择，所有候选通过同一物理世界。姿态路点、PD、分配器和刹降预测是人工设计，不能把它们说成训练自行发明。": "Each generation tests 18 candidates on 6 initial states each; CEM searches one shared parameter set. Generation 1 includes an explicitly labeled hand-tuned reference. Final parameters are selected using the fixed development set; every candidate runs through the same physics world. Attitude waypoints, PD feedback, the allocator and descent-braking predictor are hand-designed and must not be described as invented by training.",
